{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_194_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，叔弓帥師圍費。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，楚公子比自晉歸於楚，弒其君虔於乾溪。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"自晉，晉有奉焉爾。歸而弒。不言歸，言歸，非弒也。歸一事也，弒一事也，而遂言之，以比之歸弒。比不弒也。弒君者日，不日，不弒也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"三、楚公子棄疾殺公子比。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"當上之辭也。當上之辭者，謂不稱人以殺，乃以君殺之也。討賊以當上之辭，殺非弒也。比之不弒有四。取國者，稱國以弒。楚公子棄疾殺公子比，比不嫌也。春秋不以嫌代嫌，棄疾主其事，故嫌也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會劉子、晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子於平丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"五、八月，甲戌，同盟於平丘，公不與盟。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同外楚也。公不與盟者，可以與而不與，譏在公也。其日，善是盟也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"六、晉人執季孫意如以歸。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"七、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"八、蔡侯廬歸於蔡。陳侯吳歸於陳。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"善其成之會而歸之，故謹而日之。此未嘗有國也，使如失國辭然者，不與楚滅也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"九、冬，十月，葬蔡靈公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"變之不葬有三：失德不葬，弒君不葬，滅國不葬。然且葬之，不與楚滅，且成諸侯之事也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"十、公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_194_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_194","textTraditional":"十一、吳滅州來。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}